<h1>11 - Multiple schemes</h1>

<p>One app, two kinds of callers:</p>
<ul>
    <li><b>People</b> use these pages and log in with a <b>cookie</b> (tutorial 01).</li>
    <li><b>Apps</b> call <code>/api/...</code> with a <b>bearer token</b> from <code>POST /api/token</code> (tutorial 10).</li>
</ul>

<p>
    A <b>policy scheme</b> looks at each request: with an <code>Authorization: Bearer</code> header it uses JwtBearer,
    otherwise the cookie. Log in and open <b>Secret</b> to call the API with your cookie.
</p>
